{% comment %}
  Card view for the wishlist page: assets/wishlist.js fetches /products/HANDLE?view=card
  and puts the result in the [grid-wishlist] row. Uses the Metro product card.
  The .grid__item wrapper is what wishlist.js removes when a heart is un-ticked on that page.
{% endcomment %}
{%- layout none -%}
<div class="col-lg-3 col-md-4 col-sm-6 col-6 grid__item" style="margin-bottom: 16px;">
  {%- render 'ma-product-card', product: product -%}
</div>
